    "L009: \"ContractCommitmentPaymentUpfrontPercentage MUST adhere to the following requirements:\"",
    "  L011: \"ContractCommitmentPaymentUpfrontPercentage MUST be of type Decimal.\"",
    "  L012: \"ContractCommitmentPaymentUpfrontPercentage MUST conform to [NumericFormat](#attributes.numericformat) requirements.\"",
